  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Honduras Restoring Essential Services for Health and Advancing Preparedness in Emergencies (RESHAPE) Project SingleDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The development objective of the Trust Fund is to provide
 
 co-finanancing to the RESHAPE Project (the Project) with a view to: (i) improveutilization of reproductive and child health services in priorityregions in Honduras; (ii) strengthen public health capacities foremergency preparedness; and (iii) in case of an Eligible Crisis orEmergency, respond promptly and effectively to it.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
